{"pin":"AB03276","subcodes":[{"code":"AB03276","anchor":"","first_line":"Thy last letter was received and its contents brought joy. Thank thou God, for thou art engaged in serving the Word of God… With regard to the Obligatory Prayer, this should be said individually, but it is not dependent on a private spot… If thou wouldst show kindness and consideration to thy parents so that they may feel generally pleased","first_line_orig":"اگر چنانچه فی الجمله مراعات پدر و مادر را نیز بنمائی که فی الجمله راضی شوند رضایت منست  ","language":"Per","word_count":"210","translations":[{"language":"ms","lang_name":"Malay"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"COMP_FAMP#51x","source":"COMP_FAMP","locator":"51x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/family_life_compilation_originals.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"COMP_PDLP#32x","source":"COMP_PDLP","locator":"32x"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_ATE#175x","source":"BRL_ATE","locator":"175x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/481240501"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_FAM#51x","source":"BRL_FAM","locator":"51x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/340593931"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_IOPF#2.22x","source":"BRL_IOPF","locator":"2.22x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/353886098"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_PDL#32x","source":"BRL_PDL","locator":"32x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/525200035"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#0843x","source":"COC","locator":"0843x"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOG#0767x","source":"LOG","locator":"0767x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/hornby_lights_guidance_2.html\u0026chapter=1#n767"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOG#1527x","source":"LOG","locator":"1527x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/hornby_lights_guidance_2.html\u0026chapter=4#n1527"},{"kind":"translation","code":"TAB.463-464","source":"TAB","locator":"463-464","url":"https://books.google.com/books?id=0H8yAQAAMAAJ\u0026pg=PA463"}]}]}
